// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-06-13 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1218, execution
// Description: Detects indirect command execution via Program Compatibility Assistant "pcwrun.exe" leveraging
//   the follina (CVE-2022-30190) vulnerability
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://twitter.com/nas_bench/status/1535663791362519040
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_pcwrun_follina.yml
